# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supplier Quote Autopilot — public supplier form
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env` for local development (Vite only reads VITE_-prefixed vars).
#
# VITE_API_URL is the ONLY build-time configuration this app has. Everything the
# form would otherwise need to know — upload size limit, allowed file
# extensions, captcha provider/site key, honeypot field name, rate limits — is
# fetched at runtime from GET /public/config (and from the invitation preview),
# so server policy changes never require a frontend redeploy and no secret is
# ever baked into the bundle. Never put an API key or a signing secret here.
#
# The API must allow this origin via CORS, because the form is served from a
# different origin than the backend (the public form is deployed on its own
# domain, e.g. quote.buyer.com).

VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
